\otimes_{\mathcal{O}_\mathcal{X}}
b_{\QCoh, *}\mathcal{O}_\mathcal{Z} =
f_{\QCoh, *}\mathcal{O}_{\mathcal{Y} \times_\mathcal{X} \mathcal{Z}}$
where $f : \mathcal{Y} \times_\mathcal{X} \mathcal{Z} \to \mathcal{X}$
is the obvious morphism.
